! This test calculates the static electric dipole polarizability of Ne
! using the GRAC and SAOP asymptotic correction schemes.
! The chosen functionals are GRAC: PBE0gracLB94
!                        and SAOP: GLLBsaopLBalpha
!
! Note that the cc-pVDZ basis set is not appropriate for production calculations
! of polarizabilities.
!
! We assume that the cc-pVDZ basis set is available in your standard path.
